Column name: case_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original case barcode, eg TCGA-DX-A8BN
Column name: Gene Type: TEXT Description: The gene symbol. In this table, gene symbol is gene name e.g. ACADVL
Column name: Variant_Type Type: TEXT Description: Type of mutation. TNP (tri-nucleotide polymorphism) is analogous to DNP (di-nucleotide polymorphism) but for three consecutive nucleotides. ONP (oligo-nucleotide polymorphism) is analogous to TNP but for consecutive runs of four or more (SNP, DNP, TNP, ONP, INS, DEL, or Consolidated)
Column name: project_short_name Type: TEXT Description: Project name abbreviation; the program name appended with a project name abbreviation; eg. TCGA-OV, etc.
Column name: Variant_Classification Type: TEXT Description: Translational effect of variant allele
Sample rows:
[{'project_short_name': 'TCGA-GBM', 'case_barcode': 'TCGA-02-0003', 'Variant_Classification': 'Missense_Mutation', 'Variant_Type': 'SNP', 'Gene': 'ENSG00000066629'}, {'project_short_name': 'TCGA-GBM', 'case_barcode': 'TCGA-02-2470', 'Variant_Classification': 'Missense_Mutation', 'Variant_Type': 'SNP', 'Gene': 'ENSG00000078269'}, {'project_short_name': 'TCGA-LUAD', 'case_barcode': 'TCGA-05-4382', 'Variant_Classification': 'Missense_Mutation', 'Variant_Type': 'SNP', 'Gene': 'ENSG00000240303'}, {'project_short_name': 'TCGA-LUAD', 'case_barcode': 'TCGA-05-4403', 'Variant_Classification': 'Missense_Mutation', 'Variant_Type': 'SNP', 'Gene': 'ENSG00000163781'}, {'project_short_name': 'TCGA-LUAD', 'case_barcode': 'TCGA-05-4410', 'Variant_Classification': 'Missense_Mutation', 'Variant_Type': 'SNP', 'Gene': 'ENSG00000185313'}]

