Table full name: TCGA.TCGA_VERSIONED.MASKED_SOMATIC_MUTATION_HG38_GDC_R34
Column name: Tumor_Seq_Allele1 Type: TEXT Description: Primary data genotype for tumor sequencing (discovery) allele 1. A - symbol for a deletion represents a variant. A - symbol for an insertion represents wild-type allele. Novel inserted sequence for insertion does not include flanking reference bases
Column name: Reference_Allele Type: TEXT Description: The plus strand reference allele at this position. Includes the deleted sequence for a deletion or - for an insertion
Column name: SOMATIC Type: TEXT Description: Somatic status of each ID reported under Existing_variation (0, 1, or null)
Column name: Start_Position Type: NUMBER Description: Lowest numeric position of the reported variant on the genomic reference sequence. Mutation start coordinate
Column name: Chromosome Type: TEXT Description: Chromosome, possible values: chr1-22, and chrX
Column name: Tumor_Seq_Allele2 Type: TEXT Description: Primary data genotype for tumor sequencing (discovery) allele 2. A - symbol for a deletion represents a variant. A - symbol for an insertion represents wild-type allele. Novel inserted sequence for insertion does not include flanking reference bases
Column name: End_Position Type: NUMBER Description: Highest numeric genomic position of the reported variant on the genomic reference sequence. Mutation end coordinate
Column name: Variant_Classification Type: TEXT Description: Translational effect of variant allele
Column name: Hugo_Symbol Type: TEXT Description: HUGO symbol for the gene (HUGO symbols are always in all caps). Unknown is used for regions that do not correspond to a gene
Column name: Allele Type: TEXT Description: The variant allele used to calculate the consequence
Column name: Mutation_Status Type: TEXT Description: An assessment of the mutation as somatic, germline, LOH, post transcriptional modification, unknown, or none. The values allowed in this field are constrained by the value in the Validation_Status field
Sample rows:
[{'Hugo_Symbol': 'PRMT9', 'Chromosome': 'chr4', 'Start_Position': 147670697, 'End_Position': 147670697, 'Variant_Classification': 'Nonsense_Mutation', 'Reference_Allele': 'C', 'Tumor_Seq_Allele1': 'C', 'Tumor_Seq_Allele2': 'A', 'Mutation_Status': 'Somatic'}, {'Hugo_Symbol': 'SIPA1L2', 'Chromosome': 'chr1', 'Start_Position': 232443623, 'End_Position': 232443623, 'Variant_Classification': 'Missense_Mutation', 'Reference_Allele': 'C', 'Tumor_Seq_Allele1': 'C', 'Tumor_Seq_Allele2': 'A', 'Mutation_Status': 'Somatic'}, {'Hugo_Symbol': 'SIDT1', 'Chromosome': 'chr3', 'Start_Position': 113623712, 'End_Position': 113623712, 'Variant_Classification': 'Missense_Mutation', 'Reference_Allele': 'C', 'Tumor_Seq_Allele1': 'C', 'Tumor_Seq_Allele2': 'A', 'Mutation_Status': 'Somatic'}, {'Hugo_Symbol': 'DLGAP5', 'Chromosome': 'chr14', 'Start_Position': 55151703, 'End_Position': 55151703, 'Variant_Classification': 'Missense_Mutation', 'Reference_Allele': 'G', 'Tumor_Seq_Allele1': 'G', 'Tumor_Seq_Allele2': 'T', 'Mutation_Status': 'Somatic'}, {'Hugo_Symbol': 'NAV2', 'Chromosome': 'chr11', 'Start_Position': 19933847, 'End_Position': 19933847, 'Variant_Classification': 'Missense_Mutation', 'Reference_Allele': 'A', 'Tumor_Seq_Allele1': 'A', 'Tumor_Seq_Allele2': 'C', 'Mutation_Status': 'Somatic'}]

